LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "要对 ${PRODUCTNAME} 做点什么？"
LangString choowHowToInstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "选择 ${PRODUCTNAME} 的安装方式。"
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "创建桌面快捷方式"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "不卸载，直接继续"
